@startuml
title TradingBot - Scheduler + cycle state machine

hide empty description

[*] --> Boot

Boot --> BuildDependencies : main() wires app
BuildDependencies --> Running : scheduler.run_forever()

state Running {
  [*] --> Idle

  Idle --> BuildSnapshot : tick

  BuildSnapshot --> GenerateIntents : RiskContext built
  GenerateIntents --> EvaluateRisk : intents collected
  EvaluateRisk --> DecideSubmit : decisions returned

  DecideSubmit --> DryRunLog : run_mode == DRY_RUN
  DecideSubmit --> SubmitOrders : run_mode == LIVE

  DryRunLog --> Sleep
  SubmitOrders --> Sleep

  Sleep --> Idle : after cycle_seconds

  BuildSnapshot --> CycleError : broker read failed
  GenerateIntents --> CycleError : strategy failed
  EvaluateRisk --> CycleError : risk evaluation failed
  SubmitOrders --> CycleError : broker submit failed

  CycleError --> Sleep : log error, continue
}

Running --> Shutdown : SIGINT/SIGTERM
Shutdown --> [*]

note right of Running
Scenarios accounted for:
- DRY_RUN executes full pipeline but never submits.
- Partial approvals: some orders submitted, some rejected.
- No intents: EvaluateRisk runs on empty list, no submit.
- CycleError: cycle logs failure and continues next tick.
end note

@enduml
